0..70 Comment "// Divergence as a row entry. A loop the checker cannot see out of may"
71..151 Comment "// run forever, so the function holding it states `Partial` in its row: the host"
152..231 Comment "// interface with no operation, which no handler eliminates. A caller of such a"
232..312 Comment "// function holds `Partial` in its own row, as it holds any interface its callee"
313..389 Comment "// performs, so a function at the empty row returns. A call that returns and"
390..468 Comment "// whose result nothing reads is the computation that follows it. What refuses"
469..524 Comment "// is in `../../pathological/control/divergence.gandr`."
525..527 Comment "//"
528..543 Comment "// - see: #1481"
